post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/players/{{playerName}}/items
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "itemId": 6948,
    "count": 1
  }
}

docs {
  ## Items

  Grant an item to an online character.

  - Method and path: `POST /api/v1/players/{{playerName}}/items`.
  - Body: `itemId` is the item template id; `count` is 1-1000. The item must exist and respect
    `MaxCount`.
  - Write gate: `GmApi.AllowWrites = 1`.
  - Permission: `RBAC_PERM_COMMAND_ADDITEM` (488).
  - Actor: signed `X-GM-Actor` game account id; must have security above `SEC_PLAYER`.
  - Target: online character `{{playerName}}`. The API refuses the actor's own account and any
    account with security at or above the actor's.
  - Success: `200` with `{"status":"ok"}`. Audit rows: `pending` then `success`.
  - Failure: `400 bad_request` or `invalid_item`, `403 forbidden`, `404 target_not_found`,
    `409 cannot_target_self` or `inventory_full`, `500 audit_failed`, `503 world_unavailable`.

  The grant is atomic: the API stores the item only when the full count fits.
}
